1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,206
Speaking, task four. Situation number 18. The examiner will tell you a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:19,102
We want to go clothes shopping together. Where shall we go? Any idea? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,712
We can go to the shopping centre.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,710
There are too many people in the shopping centre.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,519
Then let's buy it in an online shop.

6
00:00:33,833 --> 00:00:36,226
Online I can't try the clothes on.

7
00:00:36,533 --> 00:00:37,944
Then let's go to a second-hand shop.

8
00:00:38,233 --> 00:00:39,486
And why there?

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,764
Because the clothes are cheap there and we can try them on.

10
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:45,187
OK, let's go to the second-hand shop.

11
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:55,005
Practise situation 18 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
